From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Velkov <iav@iav.lv>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 01:10:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] ODROID-C4/HC4: scp_task: wake up on the VRTC alarm

ODROID-N2 and the Amlogic u200 reference board turn IRQ_VRTC into
RTC_WAKEUP in detect_key(); C4/HC4 lacks that branch, so the alarm the
kernel sets through rtc-meson-vrtc never woke the board from suspend.
Add the same branch.

Signed-off-by: Igor Velkov <iav@iav.lv>
---
 board/hardkernel/odroidc4/firmware/scp_task/pwr_ctrl.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/board/hardkernel/odroidc4/firmware/scp_task/pwr_ctrl.c b/board/hardkernel/odroidc4/firmware/scp_task/pwr_ctrl.c
index 4a4a785..69271ab 100644
--- a/board/hardkernel/odroidc4/firmware/scp_task/pwr_ctrl.c
+++ b/board/hardkernel/odroidc4/firmware/scp_task/pwr_ctrl.c
@@ -176,6 +176,11 @@ static unsigned int detect_key(unsigned int suspend_from)
 				exit_reason = REMOTE_WAKEUP;
 		}
 
+		if (irq[IRQ_VRTC] == IRQ_VRTC_NUM) {
+			irq[IRQ_VRTC] = 0xFFFFFFFF;
+			exit_reason = RTC_WAKEUP;
+		}
+
 #ifdef CONFIG_ADC_KEY
 		if (irq[IRQ_AO_TIMERA] == IRQ_AO_TIMERA_NUM) {
 			irq[IRQ_AO_TIMERA] = 0xFFFFFFFF;
